WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:02.851
Welcome to Harbour and Co.

2
00:00:02.901 --> 00:00:05.976
Here's what your first week looks like, day by day.

3
00:00:06.950 --> 00:00:09.698
On Monday, you'll meet your team and your buddy.

4
00:00:09.748 --> 00:00:11.776
Midweek is tools training.

5
00:00:11.826 --> 00:00:17.246
On Thursday, you'll shadow a customer call, and Friday ends with a check-in with your manager.

6
00:00:17.846 --> 00:00:20.513
Everything we do comes back to three values.

7
00:00:20.563 --> 00:00:21.975
Customers first.

8
00:00:22.025 --> 00:00:23.299
Own the outcome.

9
00:00:23.349 --> 00:00:24.520
Keep it simple.

10
00:00:25.770 --> 00:00:27.194
Stuck on anything?

11
00:00:27.244 --> 00:00:32.129
Your buddy is your first stop, and the people team is always one message away.

12
00:00:32.179 --> 00:00:33.384
Welcome aboard.

